{
  "meta": {
    "is_partial": true,
    "description": "상품 그리드 + 페이지네이션. 데이터소스 이름에 직접 결합하지 않고 부모 레이아웃이 정의한 $computed.gridProducts / $computed.gridPagination 을 읽는다 (여러 레이아웃이 공유하는 partial)"
  },
  "type": "basic",
  "name": "Div",
  "children": [
    {
      "comment": "상품 그리드",
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "props": {
        "className": "grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 mb-8"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "iteration": {
            "source": "{{$computed.gridProducts ?? []}}",
            "item_var": "product"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "composite",
              "name": "ProductCard",
              "props": {
                "product": "{{product}}",
                "shopBase": "{{_global.shopBase ?? '/shop'}}",
                "preserveListQuery": true
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "빈 상태",
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "if": "{{($computed.gridProducts ?? []).length === 0}}",
      "props": {
        "className": "flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-20 px-4 my-16"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "props": {
            "className": "w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-5"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Icon",
              "props": {
                "name": "search",
                "size": "2x",
                "className": "text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "P",
          "props": {
            "className": "text-lg font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-1"
          },
          "text": "$t:shop.no_products"
        },
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "P",
          "props": {
            "className": "text-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"
          },
          "text": "$t:shop.no_search_results"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "페이지네이션 — 총 건수가 부정확하면 last_page 가 null 이므로 has_more_pages 로 판정한다",
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "if": "{{(($computed.gridPagination?.last_page ?? 0) > 1) || ($computed.gridPagination?.has_more_pages ?? false) || (($computed.gridPagination?.current_page ?? 1) > 1)}}",
      "props": {
        "className": "flex justify-center items-center gap-2 mb-12"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "comment": "이전 페이지 버튼",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Button",
          "props": {
            "className": "p-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg {{($computed.gridPagination?.current_page ?? 1) <= 1 ? 'opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed' : 'hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 cursor-pointer'}}",
            "disabled": "{{($computed.gridPagination?.current_page ?? 1) <= 1}}"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Icon",
              "props": {
                "name": "chevron-left",
                "className": "text-base"
              }
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "click",
              "handler": "navigate",
              "params": {
                "path": "{{route.path}}",
                "mergeQuery": true,
                "query": {
                  "page": "{{($computed.gridPagination?.current_page ?? 1) - 1}}"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "comment": "페이지 번호 표시",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Span",
          "props": {
            "className": "px-3 py-1 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
          },
          "text": "{{$computed.gridPagination?.last_page ? (($computed.gridPagination?.current_page ?? 1) + ' / ' + $computed.gridPagination.last_page) : ($computed.gridPagination?.current_page ?? 1)}}"
        },
        {
          "comment": "다음 페이지 버튼",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Button",
          "props": {
            "className": "p-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg {{($computed.gridPagination?.has_more_pages ?? false) ? 'hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 cursor-pointer' : 'opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed'}}",
            "disabled": "{{!($computed.gridPagination?.has_more_pages ?? false)}}"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Icon",
              "props": {
                "name": "chevron-right",
                "className": "text-base"
              }
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "click",
              "handler": "navigate",
              "params": {
                "path": "{{route.path}}",
                "mergeQuery": true,
                "query": {
                  "page": "{{($computed.gridPagination?.current_page ?? 1) + 1}}"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
